# Build context for the mapper image. The fluid-build stage needs fluid/ (and
# its lockfile) to run `next build`, but must NOT receive the host's installed
# deps or previous build output — those are recreated inside the stage and would
# otherwise clobber `npm ci`.
*
!requirements.txt
!app/
!static/
!design/
!fluid/

# Never ship host-installed frontend artifacts or a stale local export into the
# image; the fluid-build stage regenerates all of them.
fluid/node_modules
fluid/.next
fluid/out
fluid/build
static/fluid
